{"id":"650793","name":"榨菜牛肉炒饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/650793/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"乌江榨菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉洗净切薄片。","img":"images/650793/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛肉加入适量玉米淀粉抓匀。","img":"images/650793/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽抓匀。","img":"images/650793/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再加入适量花生油抓匀静置备用。","img":"images/650793/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"榨菜备用。","img":"images/650793/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋打入盆中搅拌均匀。","img":"images/650793/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮好的米饭备用。","img":"images/650793/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中热油倒入蛋液炒散后盛出。","img":"images/650793/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中热油放入牛肉翻炒。","img":"images/650793/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入榨菜。","img":"images/650793/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀入味。","img":"images/650793/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入炒过的鸡蛋，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/650793/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入米饭。","img":"images/650793/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"大火快速翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/650793/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/650793/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/650793/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/650793/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}